* SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-3.0-only
* jank mini 2, LINE IN front end (README "LINE IN"): the circuit as in parts.py, shared by the runs in linein.py.
* Models are GENERIC, not the vendors' own:
*  - OPAMP: LMV321 by its datasheet figures (TI SLOS263Y, VCC 2.7 V table): 1 MHz unity gain (one pole), 100 dB DC gain,
*    output to within 60 mV (low) / 20 mV (high) of the rails, 40 ohm output, inputs not modelled beyond ideal
*    (the inverting stage keeps both inputs at VB, inside its 0..1.7 V common-mode range).
*  - TVS: PESD5V0S2BT per line as 35 pF plus a symmetric clamp (two diodes with 6 V breakdown, back to back).
*  - ADC: the pin as a switched sampling capacitor CS (Espressif publishes no value: ASSUMED 10 pF, reset to 0 V before
*    every sample, the worst case), closed for TACQ every sample period.

.subckt OPAMP inp inn out vcc vee
G1 0 n1 inp inn 1m
R1 n1 0 100Meg
C1 n1 0 159p
Bl n2 0 V = min(max(V(n1), V(vee) + 0.06), V(vcc) - 0.02)
Rout n2 out 40
.ends

.model DZ6 D(BV=6 IBV=1m CJO=35p)
.subckt TVS line gnd
D1 line mid DZ6
D2 gnd mid DZ6
.ends

* the front end: tip / ring in, AIN = the ADC pin (GPIO9)
.subckt FRONTEND tip ring ain avdd gnd
XD7a tip gnd TVS
XD7b ring gnd TVS
R30 tip a1 20k
C30 a1 inn 1u
R31 ring a2 20k
C31 a2 inn 1u
R32 inn out 5.6k
C32 inn out 2.2n
R33 avdd vb 150k
R34 vb gnd 120k
C33 vb gnd 1u
XU6 vb inn out avdd gnd OPAMP
R35 out ain 120
C36 ain gnd 100n
.ends
